Package: shokenuse
Type: Package
Title: Visualize Claude Code Token Usage
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Martin", "Frigaard",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "mjfrigaard@pm.me"
  )
Description: A Shiny dashboard for the daily token-metrics CSV files
    written from Claude Code transcripts (one row per prompt with its
    session, project, directory, git remote, prompt text, tokens, and API
    list price cost). Shows daily token volume and cost, totals by project,
    session-level outlier detection, and the largest prompts.
